  "title": "Chocolate Pecan Pumpkin Bread",
  "description": "Throw this chocolate pumpkin bread with pecans and chocolate chips together in mere minutes for a slice of autumn comfort in no time!",
  "authors": [
    "Rachael Dcameron"
  ],
